spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given circuit

* Voltage Source
V1 1 0 DC V_in

* Resistors
R1 3 5 R_1
R2 2 4 R_2

* Op-amp
* Assuming ideal op-amp with node 2 as non-inverting input, 3 as inverting input, and 5 as output
E1 5 0 2 3 100k

* Connections
* Node 4 is connected to Vin and ground
* Node 2 connects to Vin through R2 and the non-inverting input of the opamp
* Node 3 connects to output through R1 and the inverting input of the opamp